{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGLAction","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGLAction","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbeddingGL"],"declarations":33,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.strandBraid_commute_cartan","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.strandBraid_commute_cartan","kind":"theorem","line":457,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/QuantumGLAction.lean#L457-L461","doc":"**`Ř` on strand `a` commutes with every product-weight diagonal.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.strandBraid_commute_lower","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.strandBraid_commute_lower","kind":"theorem","line":448,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/QuantumGLAction.lean#L448-L455","doc":"**`Ř` on strand `a` commutes with `Δ⁽ⁿ⁾(F_i)`.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.strandBraid_commute_raise","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.strandBraid_commute_raise","kind":"theorem","line":439,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/QuantumGLAction.lean#L439-L446","doc":"**`Ř` on strand `a` commutes with `Δ⁽ⁿ⁾(E_i)`.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.embedPair_commute_cartan","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.embedPair_commute_cartan","kind":"theorem","line":427,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/QuantumGLAction.lean#L427-L435","doc":"**Every product-weight diagonal (in particular every Cartan `K_j`) commutes with `Ř`** at\nany two distinct sites. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.cartan_entry_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.cartan_entry_eq","kind":"theorem","line":408,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/QuantumGLAction.lean#L408-L425","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.cartan","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.cartan","kind":"def","line":403,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/QuantumGLAction.lean#L403-L406","doc":"A product-weight diagonal operator `e_a ↦ (∏_k c(a_k)) e_a`.  The Cartan `K_j` is\n`c = fun x => if x = j then q else 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.lowerOp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.lowerOp","kind":"def","line":399,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/QuantumGLAction.lean#L399-L401","doc":"`Δ⁽ⁿ⁾(F_i)`, lowering `e_j ↦ e_i` (`j = i + 1`), tail weight `κ_i`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.raiseOp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.raiseOp","kind":"def","line":395,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/QuantumGLAction.lean#L395-L397","doc":"`Δ⁽ⁿ⁾(E_i)`, raising `e_i ↦ e_j` (`j = i + 1`), tail weight `κ_i`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.rCheckN_commute_delta2_single","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.rCheckN_commute_delta2_single","kind":"theorem","line":353,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/QuantumGLAction.lean#L353-L385","doc":"**`Ř` commutes with `Δ(E_{rc})` under the tail `κ`**, for `(r, c) = (j, i)` (raising,\n`e_i ↦ e_j`) and `(r, c) = (i, j)` (lowering), `j = i + 1`.  Checked in sympy at `d = 3` before\nbeing proved here for every `d`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.delta2_single_col","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.delta2_single_col","kind":"theorem","line":341,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/QuantumGLAction.lean#L341-L350","doc":"The column of `Δ(X)` for a matrix unit `X = E_{rc}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.single_apply'","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.single_apply'","kind":"theorem","line":337,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/QuantumGLAction.lean#L337-L339","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.delta2_col","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.delta2_col","kind":"theorem","line":331,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/QuantumGLAction.lean#L331-L335","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.kap","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.kap","kind":"def","line":327,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/QuantumGLAction.lean#L327-L329","doc":"The weight of the Chevalley pair `(i, j)`, `j = i + 1`: `q` on `e_j`, `qi` on `e_i`, `1`\nelsewhere. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.rCheckN_commute_wDiag2.rCheckN_ne_zero'","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.rCheckN_commute_wDiag2.rCheckN_ne_zero'","kind":"theorem","line":322,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/QuantumGLAction.lean#L322-L325","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.rCheckN_commute_wDiag2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.rCheckN_commute_wDiag2","kind":"theorem","line":311,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/QuantumGLAction.lean#L311-L325","doc":"**`Ř` commutes with `w ⊗ w` for every weight `w`**: it only permutes the two factors. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.embedPair_commute_siteOp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.embedPair_commute_siteOp","kind":"theorem","line":255,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/QuantumGLAction.lean#L255-L303","doc":"**`Ř` on an adjacent pair commutes with the iterated coproduct `Δ⁽ⁿ⁾(X)`**, given the two\ntwo-site facts: `Ř` commutes with `w ⊗ w` and with `Δ(X) = X ⊗ w + 1 ⊗ X`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.agree2_congr_right","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.agree2_congr_right","kind":"theorem","line":248,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/QuantumGLAction.lean#L248-L253","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.agree2_congr_left","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.agree2_congr_left","kind":"theorem","line":241,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/QuantumGLAction.lean#L241-L246","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.agree3_congr_right","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.agree3_congr_right","kind":"theorem","line":234,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/QuantumGLAction.lean#L234-L239","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.agree3_congr_left","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.agree3_congr_left","kind":"theorem","line":227,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/QuantumGLAction.lean#L227-L232","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.siteTerm_pair_eq_factor","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.siteTerm_pair_eq_factor","kind":"theorem","line":184,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/QuantumGLAction.lean#L184-L219","doc":"The two terms on the pair combine to `Δ(X)` on it. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.siteTerm_eq_factor_gt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.siteTerm_eq_factor_gt","kind":"theorem","line":156,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/QuantumGLAction.lean#L156-L182","doc":"A term strictly after the pair sees the identity on it. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.siteTerm_eq_factor_lt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.siteTerm_eq_factor_lt","kind":"theorem","line":123,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/QuantumGLAction.lean#L123-L154","doc":"A term strictly before the pair sees `w ⊗ w` on it. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.delta2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.delta2","kind":"def","line":113,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/QuantumGLAction.lean#L113-L117","doc":"`Δ(X) = X ⊗ w + 1 ⊗ X` on `V ⊗ V`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.wDiag2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.wDiag2","kind":"def","line":109,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/QuantumGLAction.lean#L109-L111","doc":"`w ⊗ w`, diagonal on `V ⊗ V`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.siteOp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.siteOp","kind":"def","line":103,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/QuantumGLAction.lean#L103-L107","doc":"**The iterated coproduct** `Δ⁽ⁿ⁾(X) = Σ_s 1^{⊗(s)} ⊗ X ⊗ w^{⊗(n−s−1)}`, i.e. the coproduct\n`Δ(X) = X ⊗ w + 1 ⊗ X` iterated. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.siteTerm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.siteTerm","kind":"def","line":97,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/QuantumGLAction.lean#L97-L101","doc":"`X` at site `s`, the weight `w` on every later site, the identity before. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.embedPair_commute_factorOp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.embedPair_commute_factorOp","kind":"theorem","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/QuantumGLAction.lean#L57-L93","doc":"**`Ř` at sites `i, j` commutes with `G ⊗ Z` whenever it commutes with `Z`.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.factorOp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.factorOp","kind":"def","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/QuantumGLAction.lean#L51-L55","doc":"An operator `G ⊗ Z`: `Z` on the sites `i, j`, and a kernel `G` that only reads the other\nsites. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.upd_agree","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.upd_agree","kind":"theorem","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/QuantumGLAction.lean#L46-L49","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.upd_j","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.upd_j","kind":"theorem","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/QuantumGLAction.lean#L43-L44","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.upd_i","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.upd_i","kind":"theorem","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/QuantumGLAction.lean#L39-L41","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.OffAgree","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.QuantumGL.OffAgree","kind":"def","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/QuantumGLAction.lean#L36-L37","doc":"`a` and `b` agree off the sites `i, j`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}